  "word_count": 375,
  "body_markdown": "Follow\n\n(323) 433-5990\n\nHome\n\nServices\n\nAll-On-Four\n\nDental Implants\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nAbout\n\nFAQ\n\nForms\n\nBlog\n\nContact\n\n\n# Dr. David Sewell\n\n\n\n## COSMETIC DENTIST\n\n\nDr. David Sewell is a highly accomplished dentist with over 30 years of experience, specializing in cosmetic dentistry, dental implants, and full-mouth rehabilitation. A graduate of the prestigious Southern Illinois School of Dental Medicine, Dr. Sewell earned his degree with honors in 1992.\n\nFollowing his graduation, Dr. Sewell established a thriving dental practice in Colorado, focusing on cosmetic dentistry and creating stunning smiles. To further expand his expertise, he attended the renowned LA Institute of Clinical Dentistry, where he mastered advanced techniques in implant placement, restoration, and full-mouth rehabilitation.\n\nDr. Sewell’s dedication to his craft is reflected in his prior membership in leading professional organizations, including the American Dental Association (ADA), California Dental Association (CDA), Metro Denver Dental Society (MDDS), American Academy Of Implant Dentistry, and the Academy of General Dentistry (AGD). Beyond his clinical achievements, Dr. Sewell has demonstrated a strong commitment to giving back, having led multiple dental mission trips to Central America, providing essential care to underserved communities.\n\nOriginally from the St. Louis area of southern Illinois, Dr. Sewell now calls southern California home. Outside of dentistry, he is a man of many talents and interests. Dr. Sewell enjoys acting, screenplay writing, and composing music. He has also pursued adventurous hobbies like Arabian horse endurance racing, hiking, and skiing during his time in Colorado.\n\nDr. Sewell is excited to bring his wealth of knowledge, skill, and passion for excellence to Wilshire Smile Studio, where he continues to help patients achieve their healthiest and most beautiful smiles.\n\n\n## Contact Us\n\n\nFull Name *\n\nPhone\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit\n\nWE PROVIDE THIRD PARTY FINANCING\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-on-Four-Implants\n\n\n#### Useful Links\n\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\n6200 Wilshire Blvd., #1609\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90048\n\nCopyright © 2026. Wilshire Smile Studio. All Rights Reserved. The Dental Implant Center of Los Angeles offers sedation dentistry and dental implant surgery, also serving West Hollywood, Santa Monica, Beverly Hills, and more. | Sitemap | Privacy Policy\n\nSkip to content\n\nOpen toolbar\n\nAccessibility Tools\n\nIncrease Text\n\nDecrease Text\n\nGrayscale\n\nHigh Contrast\n\nNegative Contrast\n\nLight Background\n\nLinks Underline\n\nReadable Font\n\nReset",
